#: lookandfeeltab_kcm.cpp:86 main.cpp:50
msgid ""
"<h1>Panel</h1> Here you can configure the KDE panel (also referred to as "
"'kicker'). This includes options like the position and size of the panel, as "
"well as its hiding behavior and its looks."
"<p> Note that you can also access some of these options directly by clicking on "
"the panel, e.g. dragging it with the left mouse button or using the context "
"menu on right mouse button click. This context menu also offers you "
"manipulation of the panel's buttons and applets."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Taqta</h1> Monda qaywaqıt \"kikker\" dip atalğan KDE taqtasın köylärgä "
"bula. Köylämälär arasında taqtanıñ zurlığı häm urını, yäşerenü qılanışı häm "
"qiäfätläre."
"<p> Köylämälärneñ qayberäwlären taqta üzenä qağılıp qına (mäs. küseneñ sul "
"basması belän taşu, uñ basma kontekst saylağın qullanu) üzgärtergä bula. Şuşı "
"kontekst saylağı aşa taqtan töymäläre häm appletlar belän törle ğämällär qılu "
"mömkin."

